  "description": "QINDUQ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C94 H100 Dy6 F12 N16 O26 2+,2(C1 H4 O1),2(N1 O3 1-). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 5 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 5 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 5 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 3 components; largest component is a chain with insufficient metal sites for a 3D shape classification. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.749-3.830 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 108.90-110.98°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C96H108Dy6F12N18O34.",
